# Vercel serves the React frontend only. The FastAPI app deploys to Render
# (see render.yaml), and leaving requirements.txt visible here is what makes
# Vercel misidentify this as a Python project and try to run app/ as a
# serverless function — which then crashes on every request.
app/
scripts/
docs/
venv/
.venv/
requirements.txt
render.yaml
*.db
